"columnSizing"},{"type":"text","value":" values are updated. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onChange"},{"type":"text","value":"\ncommits sizes while the resize handle is dragged; "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onEnd"},{"type":"text","value":" commits when the\nresize interaction finishes."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"enablecolumnresizing","children":[{"type":"text","value":"enableColumnResizing?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional enableColumnResizing: boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts#L30","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts:30"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Enables or disables column resizing for the whole table."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"oncolumnresizingchange","children":[{"type":"text","value":"onColumnResizingChange?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional onColumnResizingChange: OnChangeFn<columnResizingState>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts#L40","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts:40"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Called with an updater when the transient "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"columnResizing"},{"type":"text","value":" state changes.\nPair this with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"state.columnResizing"},{"type":"text","value":" when using external state; external\natoms can own the slice without this callback."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"interface-tableoptions-columnresizing","text":"Interface: TableOptions_ColumnResizing","level":1},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"columnresizedirection","text":"columnResizeDirection?","level":3},{"id":"columnresizemode","text":"columnResizeMode?","level":3},{"id":"enablecolumnresizing","text":"enableColumnResizing?","level":3},{"id":"oncolumnresizingchange","text":"onColumnResizingChange?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Interface: TableOptions\\_ColumnResizing\n\nDefined in: [features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts:20](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts#L20)\n\n## Properties\n\n### columnResizeDirection?\n\n```ts\noptional columnResizeDirection: ColumnResizeDirection;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts:34](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts#L34)\n\nSets the resize direction used to calculate drag offsets. Defaults to `ltr`.\n\n***\n\n### columnResizeMode?\n\n```ts\noptional columnResizeMode: ColumnResizeMode;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts:26](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts#L26)\n\nDetermines when committed `columnSizing` values are updated. `onChange`\ncommits sizes while the resize handle is dragged; `onEnd` commits when the\nresize interaction finishes.\n\n***\n\n### enableColumnResizing?\n\n```ts\noptional enableColumnResizing: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts:30](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts#L30)\n\nEnables or disables column resizing for the whole table.\n\n***\n\n### onColumnResizingChange?\n\n```ts\noptional onColumnResizingChange: OnChangeFn<columnResizingState>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts:40](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts#L40)\n\nCalled with an updater when the transient `columnResizing` state changes.\nPair this with `state.columnResizing` when using external state; external\natoms can own the slice without this callback.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: TableOptions_ColumnResizing\ntitle: TableOptions_ColumnResizing\n---\n\n# Interface: TableOptions\\_ColumnResizing\n\nDefined in: [features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts:20](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts#L20)\n\n## Properties\n\n### columnResizeDirection?\n\n```ts\noptional columnResizeDirection: ColumnResizeDirection;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts:34](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts#L34)\n\nSets the resize direction used to calculate drag offsets. Defaults to `ltr`.\n\n***\n\n### columnResizeMode?\n\n```ts\noptional columnResizeMode: ColumnResizeMode;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts:26](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts#L26)\n\nDetermines when committed `columnSizing` values are updated. `onChange`\ncommits sizes while the resize handle is dragged; `onEnd` commits when the\nresize interaction finishes.\n\n***\n\n### enableColumnResizing?\n\n```ts\noptional enableColumnResizing: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts:30](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts#L30)\n\nEnables or disables column resizing for the whole table.\n\n***\n\n### onColumnResizingChange?\n\n```ts\noptional onColumnResizingChange: OnChangeFn<columnResizingState>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts:40](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-resizing/columnResizingFeature.types.ts#L40)\n\nCalled with an updater when the transient `columnResizing` state changes.\nPair this with `state.columnResizing` when using external state; external\natoms can own the slice without this callback.\n"}
